    "Name": "Gatekeeper FSN",
    "Details": "The Gatekeeper FSN is an experimental Society OmniMech designed for devastating tactical nuclear bombardment. Armed with two Improved ATM-9 launchers and a single Improved ATM-6, all supplied with experimental Society fusion warheads, the design can unleash overwhelming nuclear firepower against fortified positions and concentrated enemy formations. Two Medium Supra Lasers and an Ultra Light Gauss Rifle provide conventional firepower, while a Light TAG assists with precision targeting. The FSN reflects the Society's willingness to employ extreme technological solutions to eliminate enemy resistance through overwhelming destructive force.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
